{"seq":3,"slug":"install-and-first-tenant","title":"OpenClaw 安装与首次 tenant 创建","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/openclaw/install-and-first-tenant","wordCount":1007,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"openclaw-安装与首次-tenant-创建\">OpenClaw 安装与首次 tenant 创建</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OpenClaw 的上手路径分两步：先把二进制装好（npm / Homebrew / Docker 三选一），再用 <code>openclaw init</code> 创建第一个 tenant、注册第一个 persona、配置个人 email 与 identity。本节按&quot;安装 → init → status 健康检查&quot;线性走一遍，目标是让读者在 15 分钟内拿到一个能跑的 OpenClaw 实例。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  start[开始] --&gt; install[安装 二选一]&#10;  install --&gt; npm[npm i -g openclaw]&#10;  install --&gt; brew[brew install openclaw]&#10;  install --&gt; docker[docker pull]&#10;  npm --&gt; init[openclaw init]&#10;  brew --&gt; init&#10;  docker --&gt; init&#10;  init --&gt; tenant[创建 first tenant]&#10;  tenant --&gt; persona[注册 first persona]&#10;  persona --&gt; id[配置 email/identity]&#10;  id --&gt; status[openclaw status 健康检查]\">flowchart LR\n  start[开始] --&gt; install[安装 二选一]\n  install --&gt; npm[npm i -g openclaw]\n  install --&gt; brew[brew install openclaw]\n  install --&gt; docker[docker pull]\n  npm --&gt; init[openclaw init]\n  brew --&gt; init\n  docker --&gt; init\n  init --&gt; tenant[创建 first tenant]\n  tenant --&gt; persona[注册 first persona]\n  persona --&gt; id[配置 email/identity]\n  id --&gt; status[openclaw status 健康检查]</pre><h2 id=\"三种安装路径\">三种安装路径</h2><p>OpenClaw 官方提供三种安装路径，对应不同的运维偏好。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安装方式</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>npm <code>npm i -g openclaw</code></td>\n<td>Node 生态熟悉的开发者</td>\n<td>一键升级 / 与 Node 项目共存</td>\n<td>依赖系统 Node 版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Homebrew <code>brew install openclaw</code></td>\n<td>macOS 桌面开发者</td>\n<td>与系统包管理一致</td>\n<td>Linux 不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Docker <code>docker pull openclaw:latest</code></td>\n<td>服务器 / 隔离环境</td>\n<td>环境完全隔离 / 易于回滚</td>\n<td>端口映射 / 文件挂载</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三种方式装出来的二进制行为完全一致；选择只是部署环境差异。本节示例以 npm 路径为主，其它两种在 <a href=\"deployment-modes\"><code>5_deployment-modes.md</code></a> 详细展开。</p>\n<h3 id=\"npm-安装步骤\">npm 安装步骤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"node --version          # 验证 Node &gt;=18&#10;npm i -g openclaw       # 全局安装&#10;openclaw --version      # 验证安装成功\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">node</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --version</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 验证 Node >=18</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 全局安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --version</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 验证安装成功</span></span></code></pre></div><p>如果遇到 EACCES 权限错误，建议用 nvm 管理 Node 而不是 sudo——sudo 装 global package 会污染系统目录，后续升级与回滚都很痛苦。</p>\n<h3 id=\"homebrew-安装步骤\">Homebrew 安装步骤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"brew tap openclaw/tap    # 一次性 tap 官方仓库&#10;brew install openclaw    # 安装&#10;openclaw --version       # 验证&#10;brew upgrade openclaw    # 后续升级\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tap</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> openclaw/tap</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 一次性 tap 官方仓库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --version</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upgrade</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 后续升级</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Homebrew 路径会自动管理依赖（如 sqlite、libssl），不需要单独装。</p>\n<h3 id=\"docker-安装步骤\">Docker 安装步骤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker pull openclaw/openclaw:latest&#10;docker run -d \\&#10;  --name openclaw \\&#10;  -v $HOME/.openclaw:/root/.openclaw \\&#10;  -p 8080:8080 \\&#10;  openclaw/openclaw:latest&#10;docker exec openclaw openclaw --version\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pull</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> openclaw/openclaw:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $HOME</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/.openclaw:/root/.openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 8080:8080</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  openclaw/openclaw:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> exec</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --version</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Docker 路径要把 <code>$HOME/.openclaw</code> 挂出来——这是配置 / persona / audit log 的家目录，没挂出来下次启动数据就丢了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"首次-init-创建-tenant-persona\">首次 init：创建 tenant + persona</h2><p>二进制装好后，第一步永远是 <code>openclaw init</code>。本节按交互流程拆开。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"openclaw init\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span></code></pre></div><p>init 会依次问几件事：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>tenant name</strong>：建议用&quot;组织 / 个人&quot;语义命名，如 <code>personal</code> / <code>acme-corp</code>；后续 audit log 与 key 都按 tenant 隔离。</li>\n<li><strong>first persona name</strong>：建议从最常用的 hat 开始，如 <code>dev</code>；persona 的命名空间是后续切换的依据。</li>\n<li><strong>persona identity</strong>：填 email 与 display name，会作为 chat platform onboarding 时的默认 identity。</li>\n<li><strong>storage path</strong>：默认 <code>~/.openclaw</code>，可改；Docker 用户记得这个路径要与 <code>-v</code> 挂载点匹配。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>完成后会生成两份文件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>~/.openclaw/config.yaml</code>：tenant + persona 元配置。</li>\n<li><code>~/.openclaw/personas/dev/credentials.yaml</code>：persona 级 key/secret 占位（首次为空，下一节填）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"配置-persona-的-personal-email-与-identity\">配置 persona 的 personal email 与 identity</h2><p><code>identity</code> 是 persona 的&quot;对外身份&quot;，影响后续两件事：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>chat platform onboarding 时，OAuth 回调与 identity 绑定，错配会导致 webhook 路由不到。</li>\n<li>coding agent 通过反向 MCP 拿到 <code>persona.active</code> tool 时，返回值里包含 identity 信息，被 agent 用于生成&quot;以谁的口吻&quot;的 message。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>编辑 <code>~/.openclaw/personas/dev/identity.yaml</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"persona: dev&#10;display_name: &#39;Wang Yang (dev)&#39;&#10;email: dev@example.com&#10;signature: &#39;— sent via OpenClaw / dev&#39;&#10;languages: [zh-CN, en]&#10;default_chat_platform: feishu\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">display_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Wang Yang (dev)'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dev@example.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">signature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'— sent via OpenClaw / dev'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">languages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">zh-CN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">en</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">default_chat_platform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">feishu</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>signature</code> 会在每条 outbound message 末尾自动追加（可关），便于接收方识别&quot;这是 agent 发的，不是人工&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"openclaw-status-健康检查\">openclaw status：健康检查</h2><p>init 完成后，跑一遍 status 看健康：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"openclaw status\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span></span></code></pre></div><p>输出大致结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"tenant: personal&#10;  state: active&#10;  personas: 1&#10;    - dev (state=active, chat-platforms=0, last-message=never)&#10;  audit-log: enabled (retention=30d, exported=false)&#10;  reverse-mcp: not-listening (run `openclaw mcp-serve` to start)&#10;  storage: ~/.openclaw (free=120GB)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>tenant: personal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  state: active</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  personas: 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    - dev (state=active, chat-platforms=0, last-message=never)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  audit-log: enabled (retention=30d, exported=false)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  reverse-mcp: not-listening (run `openclaw mcp-serve` to start)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  storage: ~/.openclaw (free=120GB)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每行的含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>state: active</code> 表示 tenant 已就绪；若是 <code>pending</code> 说明 init 中途中断，重跑 init 即可。</li>\n<li><code>personas</code> 行列出当前 tenant 下所有 persona，逗号后的字段是该 persona 的健康摘要。</li>\n<li><code>audit-log</code> 行确认审计开启状态；生产建议 <code>exported=true</code>（导出到 SIEM）。</li>\n<li><code>reverse-mcp</code> 行表示是否在监听反向 MCP 端口；要让 coding agent 调用 OpenClaw 必须先 <code>openclaw mcp-serve</code> 起来。</li>\n<li><code>storage</code> 行确认数据目录与可用空间。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"启动反向-mcp-server\">启动反向 MCP server</h2><p>到这一步 OpenClaw 本体已就绪，但 coding agent 还连不进来。最后一步是启动反向 MCP server：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"openclaw mcp-serve --port 8765 &amp;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openclaw</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mcp-serve</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --port</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8765</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>启动后，在 Claude Code / Codex 的 MCP 配置里加：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;openclaw&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;openclaw&quot;,&#10;      &quot;args&quot;: [&quot;mcp-stdio&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mcpServers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"openclaw\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"openclaw\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"args\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mcp-stdio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>下次 coding agent 起 session 就能看到 <code>persona.switch</code> / <code>message.send</code> / <code>route.list</code> 等 tool 可用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>init 跑两次</strong>：第二次 init 不会清旧数据但会改 config.yaml；建议先 backup <code>~/.openclaw</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>persona name 用空格 / 中文</strong>：路由规则与文件路径用 persona name 拼接，建议只用 <code>[a-z0-9-]</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>email 与 chat-platform OAuth 不一致</strong>：下一节 chat-platform onboarding 时 OAuth 回调会比对 email；不一致就会报 identity mismatch。</li>\n<li><strong>忘记跑 <code>openclaw mcp-serve</code></strong>：coding agent 看不到 tool 时第一件事就是 status 看 <code>reverse-mcp</code> 行。</li>\n<li><strong>Docker 没挂存储</strong>：容器重启数据丢失；务必 <code>-v</code> 挂卷。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三种安装路径：npm（开发者）/ Homebrew（macOS 桌面）/ Docker（隔离环境）。</li>\n<li>首次 init 创建 tenant + persona + identity，生成 <code>~/.openclaw/config.yaml</code>。</li>\n<li><code>openclaw status</code> 是健康检查入口，逐行确认 tenant / persona / audit / mcp / storage 状态。</li>\n<li>最后 <code>openclaw mcp-serve</code> 启动反向 MCP server，coding agent 才能调用。</li>\n<li>下一篇 <a href=\"chat-platform-onboarding\"><code>4_chat-platform-onboarding.md</code></a> 接入第一个 chat platform。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"OpenClaw 安装与首次 tenant 创建","id":"openclaw-安装与首次-tenant-创建"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三种安装路径","id":"三种安装路径"},{"level":3,"text":"npm 安装步骤","id":"npm-安装步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"Homebrew 安装步骤","id":"homebrew-安装步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"Docker 安装步骤","id":"docker-安装步骤"},{"level":2,"text":"首次 init：创建 tenant + persona","id":"首次-init-创建-tenant-persona"},{"level":2,"text":"配置 persona 的 personal email 与 identity","id":"配置-persona-的-personal-email-与-identity"},{"level":2,"text":"openclaw status：健康检查","id":"openclaw-status-健康检查"},{"level":2,"text":"启动反向 MCP server","id":"启动反向-mcp-server"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"OpenClaw 使用场景与目标用户","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/openclaw/use-cases-and-target-users"},"next":{"title":"OpenClaw chat-platform 接入","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/openclaw/chat-platform-onboarding"}}